<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Data Deletion — WhatsApp Messaging' }) %>
</head>
<body class="bg-light">
  <%- include('partials/legal-top', { page: 'data-deletion', heading: 'Data Deletion Instructions', updated: '13 November 2026' }) %>

    <p>
      If you have received WhatsApp messages from a business using the WhatsApp
      Messaging service operated by <strong>DNE Technology Consultants INC.</strong>,
      you can stop those messages and ask us to delete the data we hold about you.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Stop receiving messages</h2>
    <p>
      Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message you received from us. Your
      number is blocked from further messages immediately. Reply
      <strong>START</strong> if you later want to receive messages again.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Request deletion of your data</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>
        Email <a href="mailto:hello@dneco.io?subject=Data%20deletion%20request">hello@dneco.io</a>
        with the subject <strong>"Data deletion request"</strong>.
      </li>
      <li>Include the WhatsApp phone number, with country code (for example +91 98200 11234).</li>
      <li>
        We may ask you to confirm you control that number, for example by
        sending a WhatsApp message from it, before we delete anything.
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      We complete verified requests within <strong>30 days</strong> and email
      you a confirmation when it is done.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">What we delete</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>messages sent to your number, including their content and delivery status;</li>
      <li>messages you sent to us, including any media references;</li>
      <li>your name and contact record;</li>
      <li>phone-number validation results for your number;</li>
      <li>delivery events and notifications we stored about those messages.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Your number is removed from bulk-send records, which keep only anonymous
      totals.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">What we keep</h2>
    <p>
      If you opted out (sent STOP), we keep your phone number and the date you
      opted out, and nothing else. We need this so we never message you again.
      We may also keep information where the law requires it. Ask us if you
      want the opt-out record removed too, but we may then be unable to stop
      future messages to you.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Data held by Meta</h2>
    <p>
      WhatsApp is operated by Meta, which processes messages under its own
      terms and privacy policy. To manage data held by WhatsApp itself, see
      <a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/privacy-policy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">WhatsApp's Privacy Policy</a>
      or use the settings in your WhatsApp app.
    </p>

  <%- include('partials/legal-bottom') %>
</body>
</html>
